flowchart TD
  U[User asks for real public Agent chat] --> A[A candidate: outbound runner only]
  U --> B[B candidate: Worker + Tunnel + Runtime]
  U --> C[C candidate: hybrid]
  A --> AS[Safe, no inbound Mac surface, but only async final text in V1]
  B --> BS[True SSE chat, but Tunnel is not authorization]
  C --> CS[Use B for sync chat and A for identity, heartbeat, lease, result]
  AS --> J[Arbitration]
  BS --> J
  CS --> J
  J --> V1[V1 winner: C]
  V1 --> DP[Sync data plane: Browser -> Worker -> Tunnel -> Local Runtime]
  V1 --> CP[Async control plane: Runner -> register, heartbeat, lease, result]
  DP --> OL[Ollama loopback personal runtime]
  DP --> DS[DeepSeek provider API]
  DP --> KM[Kimi provider API]
  DP --> QW[Qwen provider API]
  DP --> ZP[Zhipu provider API]
  CP --> AU[Result audit and future long task workflow]
